This repository is an out-of-tree (OOT) platform plugin for SGLang. Portions of
the source files under sglang_kunlun/hooks/ and sglang_kunlun/kernels/ are
adapted from SGLang in order to replace or extend upstream implementations for
Kunlun XPU hardware. Every such file carries an "Adapted from" notice in its
file header, as required by Apache-2.0 sections 4(b) and 4(c). Copyright in the
unmodified portions of that code remains with the SGLang Team.

================================================================================
2. Kunlun XPU runtime components  (required at run time, NOT distributed here)
================================================================================

This repository contains source code only. It does not bundle, vendor, or
redistribute any prebuilt binary, wheel, or container image.

The plugin imports the following packages at run time. They must already be
present in the target environment; each is distributed by its own copyright
holders under its own license terms:

  - torch_xmlir        (Kunlun-enabled PyTorch runtime)
  - kunlun_ops         (Kunlun operator library)
  - sgl_kernel         (SGLang kernel library, Apache-2.0)
  - triton             (Apache-2.0)
  - xspeedgate_ops
  - deep_ep            (Kunlun port of DeepEP)
  - cocopod

Obtaining and licensing these components is the responsibility of whoever
builds the runtime environment; this repository grants no rights to them.

